  "prefLabel": "Env-Sw 102.29 Call",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-Sw 102.29 “Call” means action by the department to invoke the provisions of a temporary permit requiring the permittee to either commence the facility closure proces or the process for obtaining a permanent permit issued pursuant to RSA 149-M and the solid waste rules for continued operation of the facility.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note #1 at chapter heading for Env-Sw 100) #8460-B, eff 10-28-05; ss by #14103, effective 10-23-24 (formerly Env-Sw 102.25) (see Revision Note #2 at chapter heading for Env-Sw 100)",
